  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7501.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7501.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to set forth:\n\n(a) Scope of hearings for financial responsibility at the division of motor vehicles;\n\n(b) Motor vehicle accident reporting requirements;\n\n(c) A uniform point system for identifying frequent violators of traffic laws;\n\n(d) The approval process for driver improvement courses; and\n\n(e) The approval process for driver attitude courses.\n\nSource. #13938, eff 4-24-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 7500)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c7500.html"
